    "ssky_text_block_ipBKbJ": {
      "type": "ssky-text-block",
      "blocks": {
        "caption_YfzXdJ": {
          "type": "caption",
          "settings": {
            "caption": "Durable, Engaging, and Perfect Books for Little Hands",
            "custom_color": "",
            "text_style": "large-bold",
            "color_class": "primary-blue"
          }
        },
        "text_yADrGn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "max_width": 100,
            "custom_color": "",
            "alignment": "left",
            "text": "<p>Board books are a great way to introduce your child to reading early on. Our high-quality, baby-friendly books are made from thick, durable board that can handle the teething and tossing that come with babies and toddlers. We’ve designed our board books to be as engaging as they are educational, so your little one can start learning valuable lessons while enjoying vibrant illustrations and interactive content.</p><h2>Benefits of Board Books for Toddlers and Children</h2><p>Board books offer more than just fun. They play an important role in your child's development. Here’s why our sturdy, hands-on books are a great choice for your baby or toddler.</p><h3>Durability for Active Little Hands</h3><p>Babies and toddlers can be rough with their belongings, especially books. Our board books have thick, sturdy pages that stand up to lots of use. Your baby can flip, chew, or toss them, and they’ll still last. Their strong design means our books stay together, even after many hours of play.</p><h3>Early Motor Skill Development</h3><p>Board books are great for learning, but they’re also fantastic for helping your child develop essential motor skills. The thick pages are easy for your baby or toddler to grasp, turn, and explore. This simple action of flipping pages helps improve their hand-eye coordination, dexterity, and fine motor skills. Plus, they’re perfect for interactive reading sessions, where your child can “help” turn the pages as you read aloud about the <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-toddlers-abcs-of-the-american-revolution\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">American Revolution</span></a>, <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-toddlers-abcs-of-economics\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Economics</span></a>, and everything in between.</p><h3>Safe, Non-Toxic Materials</h3><p>When it comes to babies, safety is always our top priority. Our toddler books are made with non-toxic materials, so you don’t have to worry about harmful chemicals. Each book is carefully crafted to ensure it’s safe for your little one to explore, even if they decide to chew on the pages. The rounded corners prevent any accidental pokes, giving you complete peace of mind.</p><h3>Engaging Stories and Colorful Illustrations</h3><p>Our board books are educational and eye-catching. Bright colors and bold pictures grab your child’s attention, making reading enjoyable. From learning simple ideas to listening to a story, our books help create a happy space for early learning. The stories are short and simple, just right for young children.</p><h3>A Foundation for Early Learning</h3><p>Reading with your child from an early age helps build a strong foundation for future learning. Our board books are the perfect introduction to the world of books, teaching your little one about <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-toddlers-123s-of-helping\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Helping</span></a>, <a href=\"https://tuttletwins.com/products/the-tuttle-toddlers-abcs-of-liberty\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Liberty</span></a>, and even values like kindness and empathy. With interactive content and simple, yet valuable lessons, our board books support the development of early literacy skills that benefit your child as they grow.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_size": "regular",
            "text_weight": "regular"
          }
        }
      },
