        },
        "faq_9XmEpe": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What Book Should a Two-Year-Old Read?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Early learning books for 2-year-olds should be fun, colorful, and teach basic ideas like numbers, letters, and simple phrases. Tuttle Toddlers books are a fantastic choice because of their enjoyable and interactive stories.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_49jae6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>What Age Range Are Toddler Books For?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Toddler books are for children between the ages of 1 and 4. These books are all about helping your toddler learn basic skills like counting, reading, and learning about the world in ways that are easy to understand.</p><p>Tuttle Toddlers books are ideal early learning books for 3-year-olds.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_D74DWn": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Can a Child Start Reading At 2?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>At age 2, most kids can't read on their own, but they can start learning the fundamentals of reading, such as how to recognize letters, sounds, and words. Our books teach these ideas in a fun and easy-to-understand style, which will encourage your child to learn to read and write early on.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_dnCVCf": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>How Old Should My Child Be to Use Board Books?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Board books are ideal for babies as young as 6 months old and can be enjoyed well into the toddler years. Their sturdy construction and engaging illustrations make them a great choice for children who are just beginning to explore the world of reading.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_bG3HRE": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Are Your Board Books Safe for Babies to Chew On?</p>",
            "text_size": "medium",
            "text_weight": "bold",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, all of our board books are made with non-toxic materials, ensuring they’re safe for babies to chew on. The rounded corners also mean there’s no chance your little one can hurt themselves on pointy edges.</p>",
            "text_size_b": "medium",
            "text_weight_b": "regular"
          }
        },
        "faq_LKTXgx": {
